# Prebuilt GoogleSQL shim: the one place that pins it. Read by crates/googlesql-sys/build.rs,
# scripts/package-shim.sh, the Dockerfile and the CI workflows. Plain KEY=VALUE, no quotes or
# expansions (build.rs parses it by hand). How to bump: docs/building.md.
#
# GOOGLESQL_VERSION  googlesql release in MODULE.bazel (archive_override).
# SHIM_VERSION       bumped whenever the shim's sources change (native/googlesql/shim, BUILD.bazel, ...).
# SHIM_SOURCE_SHA256 hash of the shim's sources the archives were built from
#                    (`scripts/package-shim.sh --source-hash`); build.rs refuses a download when the
#                    tree no longer matches, because the archive would be stale.
# SHA256_<platform>  checksum of googlesql-shim-<GOOGLESQL_VERSION>-s<SHIM_VERSION>-<platform>.tar.gz.
#                    Empty: no archive published for that platform yet.
# The archives are GitHub release assets under the tag shim-<GOOGLESQL_VERSION>-s<SHIM_VERSION>.
GOOGLESQL_VERSION=2026.11.2
SHIM_VERSION=14
SHIM_RELEASE_URL=https://github.com/strise/spanbolt/releases/download
SHIM_SOURCE_SHA256=363871fe8fad8f1c63921050b982e26ae8780d5cf00542111d1da44430719d51
SHA256_darwin_arm64=d368908a6b225ca098d2aaced457af752a9d4d673c72cf8e237e490441cbe5ab
SHA256_linux_arm64=4466ed11b972bda3360c664654dc88909f87e5461e59d994760e26f492186a62
SHA256_linux_x86_64=9778c57c33ccbbefade550fa0bcaa82c6fed5c03d68ec22c8476ea808049f3d3
